    "title": "Find the Middle Index in Array",
    "category": "Prefix Sum",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array, return the leftmost index where the sum of elements before it equals the sum of elements after it. If no such index exists, return -1.",
